    <p>
      XMR4EL runner totals include loading and saving. PECOS training excludes feature fitting/export
      and model saving. Memory is the child command's process high-water RSS, rounded to one decimal;
      it is not whole-container RAM or GPU memory. The recorded memory scale is neither GB nor GiB.
      The 1-NN logs do not record embedding-cache state. These are single-run measurements.
    </p>
